; MARK: 11: 💬 レイアの主張
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論シーン1-11 レイアの主張
; BGM変更：AccUhEarts(Vocal無)
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_15_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

# Judge1-11-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:エマくんの推理には、<br>大きな穴がある。<br>……きっと私たちは<br>こんな所に囚われているせいで、<br>正常な判断ができなく<br>なっているんだよ。|#0101Trial11_Leia001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私達が死体を見逃した事、<br>ノアくんが黙って殺された事……<br>その他の<br>さまざまなことだってそうさ。|#0101Trial11_Leia002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,58 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR10,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"エマくんの推理では<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_11_01\">説明がつかない</link>ことだらけだ。<br>不自然な事ばっかりじゃないか。|#0101Trial11_Leia003|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,58 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:あら。<br>不自然と言っても、<br>この監獄には<br>【魔法】があるのよ？<br>何があっても<br>おかしくないんじゃ<br>ないかしら？|#0101Trial11_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,51 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:本当にそうだろうか。<br>私たちの魔法にだって、<br>一定のルールや法則は<br>あるはずだよ。|#0101Trial11_Leia004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,52 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"たとえば私の<br><link=\"Objection_01_01_11_02\">【魅了】の魔法</link>……。<br>みんなに<link=\"Objection_01_01_11_03\">恋心</link>を<br>抱かせてしまう、<br>罪な魔法だね。|#0101Trial11_Leia005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,55 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"けど、<link=\"Objection_01_01_11_04\">私の魔法</link>では<br>ノアくんを<link=\"Objection_01_01_11_05\">静かに殺したり、</link><br>死体を隠すことはできないんだよ。|#0101Trial11_Leia006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,58 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yell_Open01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Leia Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:4
@PrintDebateText Text:今は仲間内での疑い合いなんて、<br>している場合じゃないよ……。<br>みんな！<br>信じ合う心を取り戻そう！|#0101Trial11_Leia007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:68,59 Roll:4

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:true ProcessTimer:true
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

